    "description": "## Prototype\n\nView and edit completed climbing sessions.\n\n**Routes:**\n\n* `/dashboard` — recent sessions + toggle All\n* `/sessions` — full session list\n* `/sessions/[id]` — session detail\n* `/sessions/[id]/edit` — edit session\n\n**Local web:** http://localhost:8081/sessions?demo=seed\n\n**Scenarios:** http://localhost:8081/scenarios (ROKJ-17 section)",
